### 1. List all rooms (expect 200, 3 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. Filter by capacity (expect 2 rooms)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6

### 3. Filter by keyword (expect 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?keyword=pod

### 4. Both filters (expect 1 room)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6&keyword=roof

### 5. One room (expect 200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 6. Missing room (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 7. Create (expect 201 + Location: /api/rooms/4)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rooftop", "capacity": 12 }

### 8. Replace (expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Roof", "capacity": 10 }

### 9. Replace missing room (expect 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost", "capacity": 5 }

### 10. Delete (expect 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4

### 11. Delete again (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/4
